# 🚀 SUPREME OS — Quick Start Guide

## Installation

\`\`\`bash
npm install @supreme-os/sdk
\`\`\`

## 5-Minute Quick Start

### 1. Get API Key
Sign up at [supreme-os.com](https://supreme-os.com) → Dashboard → API Keys

### 2. Initialize SDK

\`\`\`javascript
const SupremeSDK = require('@supreme-os/sdk');

const supreme = new SupremeSDK({
    apiKey: 'sk_live_your_api_key_here'
});
\`\`\`

### 3. Search & Register Domain

\`\`\`javascript
// Search
const search = await supreme.domain.search('mycoolstartup');
// → { available: true, price: 12.99 }

// Register
const domain = await supreme.domain.register({
    domain: 'mycoolstartup',
    tld: 'com'
});
// → { status: 'registered', domain: 'mycoolstartup.com' }
\`\`\`

### 4. Deploy Website (One Click)

\`\`\`javascript
const deploy = await supreme.domain.deploy(domain.data.id);
// → { status: 'deploying', progress: 0 }

// Check status
setTimeout(async () => {
    const status = await supreme.domain.get(domain.data.id);
    console.log(status.data.deployProgress); // 100
    console.log(status.data.url); // https://mycoolstartup.com
}, 30000);
\`\`\`

### 5. Add AI Chatbot

\`\`\`javascript
const chatbot = await supreme.ai.createAgent({
    name: 'My Site Assistant',
    knowledge: ['https://mycoolstartup.com'],
    model: 'gpt-4'
});

// Add to your website
console.log(`<script src="https://supreme-os.com/chatbot/${chatbot.data.id}.js"></script>`);
\`\`\`

## 🎉 You're Live!

Your domain is registered, website deployed, and AI chatbot is running.
Total time: ~5 minutes.
Total cost: $12.99/year for domain + $19/month for AI.

